OL,3,ABinance says crypto worth $6.3bn
OL,4,Aimpacted in suspected hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCryptocurrency giant Binance said on
OL,7,FThursday that a "security incident" on
OL,8,Fits platform has impacted about $6.3bn
OL,9,F(#4.7bn) of assets.
OL,11,FThe world's biggest crypto exchange
OL,12,Fsaid about half of those assets have
OL,13,Fbeen frozen with the help of other
OL,14,Fplatforms, adding that it will "cover
OL,15,Fall losses".
OL,17,FEarly checks show the suspected hack
OL,18,Fmay have involved an engineer's laptop
OL,19,Fthat had been compromised, which
OL,20,Fallowed an attacker to make
OL,21,Funauthorised withdrawals, Binance said
OL,22,Fin a series of online alerts.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
